                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Letter from Mr. Gregg of September 12</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Memoranda.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Complaining of procrastination in regard to the treaty which he said was
                    completed August 19 satisfactorily.</p>
                <p>Remonstrates again November 1 as above.</p>
            </div>
